  "observed": {
    "managed": "Real roster showed current army3 original selections/disclosed-empty declarations and other public army1 selection/undisclosed declarations. Actual overflow scrolling exposed every row. Board zoom then read-only roster click removed board focus; F and panel wheel kept camera framing unchanged. Choice and explicit Refresh cleared roster to unavailable while busy, then restored it. A fixed choice9\u219211; empty curtain; B9/local0 showed reversed ownership/disclosure, Tactical committed13 and Refresh. Maximize/Restore kept wrapped text and board fit; captures3840x2088 and2882x1668. Empty handback then A14/local0 restored its own fixed mission and current public disclosure.",
    "attachDiagnostic": "Player-a fixed choice committed11. Actual UI Ctrl+A/C copied the session ID privately. Handoff cleared the roster/board/ID/options before Ready. Invalid player-b credential produced actual HTTP401 authentication_required: A valid bearer credential is required. Outgoing roster stayed absent under the curtain; no automatic creation or old view returned. Normal close left separate host healthy.",
    "attachRecovery": "A fresh ordinary client pasted the copied ID with actual Ctrl+V and opened the same player-a11/local0 projection, fixed mission and public roster. No current own offered choice remained, so it retained the known result. Handoff cleared again, then Ready restored player-b9/local0 with current-viewer label, own disclosed-empty declarations, other army undisclosed, and own current choices. Actual panel scroll exposed its full roster. No recovery-client choice was submitted. Normal close left Core healthy; separate owner then stopped it normally."
  },
